<div class="sc-hero-band" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="light" data-fade="none" style="background:#fff;position:relative;z-index:1;overflow:hidden;"><img src="~/images/circuit-board-blue.webp" aria-hidden="true" style="position:absolute;top:15px;right:-80px;width:300px;height:300px;opacity:0.4;pointer-events:none;z-index:0;user-select:none;transform:rotate(8deg);" /><div class="cap-section cap-section--band cap-section--hero"><div style="margin-bottom:64px;">
    <div style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:10px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--hana-blue);margin-bottom:14px;">Automation &amp; Smart Manufacturing &middot; Sub-capability</div>
    <h1 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:46px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.06;letter-spacing:-0.03em;margin:0 0 18px;max-width:740px;text-wrap:balance;">Robotic and smart manufacturing</h1>
    <p style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:18px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.55;max-width:660px;margin:0 0 32px;text-wrap:pretty;">Hana applies automation where repeatability, throughput and process control are critical. Capabilities include robotic soldering, coating and potting, operator-free singulation, automated handling and test, and inspection integrated directly into the manufacturing line.</p><p style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:18px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.55;max-width:660px;margin:0 0 32px;text-wrap:pretty;">Our automated processes also generate production data that can be used for traceability, sorting, defect handling and downstream process control.</p>
    <div style="position:relative;overflow:hidden;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid var(--line);width:100%;height:407px;"><img src="/images/photos/cap-automation-robotic-smart-manufacturing-hero.webp" alt="Twin-gantry flying-probe machine over a panel of PCBAs" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;" /></div>
    <div class="hana-spec-block" style="margin-top:18px;"><div class="hana-spec-item"><div class="hana-spec-label" style="display:block;margin-bottom:8px;">Soldering, coating &amp; potting cells</div><div class="hana-spec-value" style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:17px;">Robotic</div></div><div class="hana-spec-item"><div class="hana-spec-label" style="display:block;margin-bottom:8px;">3D AOI resolution</div><div class="hana-spec-value" style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:17px;">7 &micro;m</div></div><div class="hana-spec-item"><div class="hana-spec-label" style="display:block;margin-bottom:8px;">Auto-singulation with e-map scrap</div><div class="hana-spec-value" style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:17px;">Operator-free</div></div><div class="hana-spec-item"><div class="hana-spec-label" style="display:block;margin-bottom:8px;">Package-level AOI</div><div class="hana-spec-value" style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:17px;">6 sides</div></div></div>
  </div></div></div>
<div class="sc-pillars-band" data-hana-bg="wafer" data-variant="light" data-accent="" data-fade="none" style="background:linear-gradient(120deg,#f5f7fa 35%,#d8e6f3 100%);position:relative;overflow:hidden;"><div class="cap-section cap-section--band"><div style="margin-bottom:64px;"><div style="margin-bottom:26px;"><h2 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:28px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin:0;">Capability overview</h2><p style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:15.5px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.6;max-width:640px;margin:10px 0 0;">Automation spans three areas: process cells carrying out manufacturing operations, automated handling and test systems moving material through production, and in-line inspection providing continuous process verification.</p></div>
