x;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.5;">Film-frame handling, map-driven sorters, and wafer probers feeding sort</span></li><li style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:16px 1fr;gap:8px;align-items:baseline;padding:6px 0;"><span style="color:var(--hana-blue);font-weight:700;">&rsaquo;</span><span style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.5;">Dedicated medical and automotive lines on top</span></li></ul>
        
      </div>
    </div>
      <div class="sc-pillar" style="border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius-card);overflow:hidden;background:#fff;display:flex;flex-direction:column;">
