</style><div style="background:#fff;"><div class="cap-section cap-section--why"><div><div style="margin-bottom:26px;"><h2 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:28px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin:0;">Smart Manufacturing at Hana</h2></div><div class="cap-row-2">
